# Go. Both binaries land here when built without -o, which `go build ./...`
# does by default.
/rgit
/rgit-install
/dist/
*.test
*.out

# go tool cover -html writes this by hand; the Makefile itself never
# generates it (cover/cover-short only run -func), but whoever runs the
# command shouldn't have to remember to keep it out of a commit.
coverage.html

# Local agent/editor settings. Nothing here is shared, and the only thing
# stopping an accidental commit otherwise is whatever global ignore file the
# committer happens to have.
.claude/

# Generated by cmd/rgit-install's generateSQLParser (17.4 MB / 674k lines at
# the upstream module's own gitignored source) -- never committed.
/internal/resolve/sqlgrammar/csrc/

